@startuml RF25_Sequencia_Hype
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 15
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam ArrowColor #52606D
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDEB
  BorderColor #D8CE78
  FontColor #554F24
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
  ActorBorderColor #4A4852
  GroupBorderColor #CBC6BE
  GroupBackgroundColor #FAF8F5
}
autonumber "<b>0."
title RF25 — Criar & editar selo de marca/celebridade (formulário + arte) e política de promoção\nDiagrama de sequência — gerado do código em 2026-10-14 (scripts/diagramas/v5)

actor "Pessoa usuária" as U
boundary "Tela /brands/[slug]" as P
control "SealController" as SealController
participant "SealDesignService" as SealDesignService
database "MySQL" as DB_MySQL
participant "MediaStoragePort\n(LocalFileMediaStorage, S3MediaStorageAdapter)" as MediaStoragePort
participant "SealService" as SealService
== Enviar selo pronto (1:1, circular, 256–4096 px) ou, com purpose=core,… ==
U -> P : Enviar selo pronto (1:1, circular, 256–4096 px) o…
P -> SealController : POST /api/seals/uploads
SealController -> SealDesignService : uploadCore()
activate SealDesignService
SealDesignService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT users
alt Só perfis de marca ou celebridade criam…
SealDesignService --> SealController : 403 ACESSO_NEGADO
SealController --> P : 403 + mensagem
end
alt nucleo pequeno
SealDesignService --> SealController : 400 NUCLEO_PEQUENO
SealController --> P : 400 + mensagem
end
alt nucleo proporcao
SealDesignService --> SealController : 400 NUCLEO_PROPORCAO
SealController --> P : 400 + mensagem
end
SealDesignService -> MediaStoragePort : put()
deactivate SealDesignService
SealDesignService --> SealController : resultado
SealController --> P : 201 JSON
P --> U : atualiza a tela
== Copilot #createsealpolicy: cria o modelo de referência a partir do pe… ==
U -> P : Copilot #createsealpolicy: cria o modelo de refer…
P -> SealController : POST /api/seals/draft
SealController -> SealService : draft()
activate SealService
deactivate SealService
SealService --> SealController : resultado
SealController --> P : 201 JSON
P --> U : atualiza a tela
@enduml
